# Generated outputs are never hand-merged: scripts/merge-generated.sh keeps
# the current side and the post-merge/post-rewrite hooks regenerate them from
# the merged inputs (scripts/regenerate-after-merge.sh). Without the driver
# registered (`pnpm install` does it), these conflict like any text file.
**/*.gen.ts merge=cubby-generated
**/*.gen.json merge=cubby-generated
**/src/generated/** merge=cubby-generated
